{{- /*
Code shape: the digits lead, above the prose. A sign-in code is read, retyped
and discarded in about ten seconds, and a reader made to scan a paragraph first
has been taxed for the one thing they opened the message to get.
*/ -}}
{{- define "login_code" -}}
{{- template "chrome.shape_code" (dict "Doc" . "Accent" "#6f6bd8" "Tint" "#f0efff") -}}
{{- end -}}
